{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The Breeze feels like a natural follow-up to Old Sock and People, Hell & Angels because I want a relaxed blues-rock listen today.",
    "Several choices fit my interest in veteran rock artists, while All Your Favorite Bands appeals through its roots-rock direction."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "This House Is Not For Sale does not feel as close to the rootsy sound I want today, even though it broadly fits rock listening.",
    "Live in Hollywood gives me too little information to feel confident choosing it, and the Eagles collection is more music than I want to explore in this visit."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "Familiar classic rock seems to carry too much weight when my strongest interest today is blues and roots-oriented music.",
    "An established artist or familiar album is not enough on its own to make something my next choice."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "The connection between Old Sock, People, Hell & Angels, and the blues-oriented appeal of The Breeze matters more to me today than broad rock familiarity.",
    "I rarely choose something unless it feels clearly relevant, and today I want one compelling album rather than a collection or several possibilities that need more listening first."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The choices capture my broad rock interests, but only a few reflect the specific blues and roots-oriented listen I want today."
}"}
